      "en": "As they continued on and talked, behold, a chariot of fire and horses of fire separated them; and Elijah went up by a whirlwind into heaven.",
      "ko": "두 사람이 행하며 말하더니 홀연히 불수레와 불말들이 두 사람을 격하고 엘리야가 회리바람을 타고 승천하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "165bfd9e67a393e357765d4159ac02e0117a266afecf19ef5e490afdd221e553",
      "translation_text_hash": "b826114936b026491f3f5eb7c9cdc5bcc9201be22396ffd42489b07f681be8d0",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
