      "en": "He took Elijah’s mantle that fell from him, and struck the waters, and said, “Where is the LORD, the God of Elijah?” When he also had struck the waters, they were divided apart, and Elisha went over.",
      "ko": "엘리야의 몸에서 떨어진 그 겉옷을 가지고 물을 치며 가로되 엘리야의 하나님 여호와는 어디 계시니이까 하고 저도 물을 치매 물이 이리 저리 갈라지고 엘리사가 건너니라",
      "source_text_hash": "54449ed3a8acbda939e777d7a41620f3bc30dbda83d340463366eb63d85d83cc",
      "translation_text_hash": "203e1af0daa5620cf18107337c9b80d837ea0165070a9ee299d5e14ce7263688",
